sequenceDiagram
  title SD-60A – Xem hóa đơn đã phát hành
  actor KT as Kế toán
  participant WEB as Web JPULSE
  participant API as JPULSE API
  participant DB as Firestore JPULSE
  participant MISA as MISA meInvoice
  KT->>WEB: Chọn xem hóa đơn
  WEB->>API: Yêu cầu link xem · HTTP/JSON
  activate API
